{"title":"Deathstalker Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 32 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (5.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 3 | venomChance: .4 | venomDamage: 20</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"deathstalker-scorpion\" data-map-level=\"34\">Show level 34 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 18 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scorpion-carapace\" title=\"Scorpion Carapace - in 89% of 18 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 69 total, 1–12 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/29de9072db7d3b475f5a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scorpion Carapace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">89% · 16/18</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scorpion-stinger\" title=\"Scorpion Stinger - in 67% of 18 looted corpses, 12 recorded drops, 31 total, 1–9 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/977ab05583e7ccda91b0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scorpion Stinger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 12/18</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 6% of 18 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/18</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"scorpion-carapace\" title=\"Scorpion Carapace - in 89% of 18 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 9 total, 9 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/29de9072db7d3b475f5a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scorpion Carapace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">89% · 16/18</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-902.3px,-944.3px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:881.6px;top:956.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:938.5px;top:954.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:956.8px;top:942.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:882.4px;top:930.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:851.2px;top:938.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:776.8px;top:962.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:847.8px;top:942.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:925.7px;top:934.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:906.0px;top:954.0px\"></i><i style=\"lef